timestamp=2026-11-09T09:01:58.878Z level=INFO run=dc3d0a36 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 << 'PY'\n# With 28-day (4-week) periods starting on 2025-03-04 (Tuesday), period boundaries are 03-04, 04-01, 04-29, 05-27, 06-24 etc.\n# Now look at our data dates: earliest 2025-03-04, latest 2025-06-30.\n# So entries on 2025-03-04 would belong to the first period starting 03-04. Entries after 06-24 (like 06-30) would belong to the period starting 06-24 (running to ~07-22)? That gives us 5 billing months/periods covering most data up to end of June.\n# That seems plausible. Also \"monthly salary\" — billing month as defined by that cycle.\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
