timestamp=2026-11-09T09:02:58.116Z level=INFO run=dc3d0a36 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 << 'PY'\n# Now compute salaries\nresult = defaultdict(list)\n# get all (emp, period) keys\nkeys = set(hours_by_emp_period.keys()) | set(bonus_by_emp_period.keys())\nfor eid, pk in keys:\n    hr = float(emp_by_pesel[eid]['hourly_rate'])\n    total_hours = hours_by_emp_period.get((eid, pk), 0.0)\n    total_bonus = bonus_by_emp_period.get((eid, pk), 0.0)\n    salary = total_hours * hr + total_bonus\n    # round to nearest integer using standard mathematical rounding\n    salary_rounded = round(salary)\n    result[eid].append((pk, salary_rounded))\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
